ht of the lamp’s viewpoint. The desk appears even further to the right and slightly behind the bed, but since the question asks for the location of the bed relative to the lamp and TV, the bed lies in the front-right direction.\n\nA<abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>Thus, the perspective transformation involves rotating the camera clockwise from the lamp's position toward the center of the room, showing the TV first, then the bed to its right.\n</spatial_thinking>\n\n<thinking><abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>Standing at the lamp’s position (as shown in image 9), the television is directly in front. The bed, visible in images 10-12, is positioned to the right of the television. Therefore, from the lamp’s viewpoint, the bed is located in the front-right direction.\n\nT<abs_vis_token><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad><abs_vis_token_pad></abs_vis_token>This matches option C: front-right.\n</thinking>\n\n<answer>C</answer><|im_end|>","latent":{"blocks":5,"body_tokens":80,"events":[{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":0,"kind":"section_entry","body_tokens":16},{"phase":"spatial_thinking","boundary":1,"kind":"source_step","body_token